{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your VR headset and unleash chaos as a mighty gorilla rampaging through the city!</strong> Smash skyscrapers, grab debris, and hurl it across the streets to destroy everything in your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can see it, you can break it. Every building crumbles into hundreds of pieces \u2013 and those pieces aren\u2019t just rubble, they\u2019re your weapons. Pick them up, throw them around, and watch the city collapse under your fists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/ed85971cb6ddef4ecaef0bf937d5a129.poster.avif?t=1769074530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/ed85971cb6ddef4ecaef0bf937d5a129.webm?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/ed85971cb6ddef4ecaef0bf937d5a129.mp4?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wrong Way, Humans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cars? Perfect projectiles. Grab them and ruin traffic forever. Helicopters? Nothing more than pesky flies. Even tanks don\u2019t stand a chance \u2013 your fists will flatten them like paper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/63ceca5bc71480da50f6f387dfac7553.poster.avif?t=1769074530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/63ceca5bc71480da50f6f387dfac7553.webm?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/63ceca5bc71480da50f6f387dfac7553.mp4?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absolute Freedom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in Free Mode, where the city is your playground. Smash buildings, rack up points, and dodge incoming missiles. Pound your chest to unleash a powerful special attack and spread destruction with no limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/846e646e260375cf28f742cf90b5e27c.poster.avif?t=1769074530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/846e646e260375cf28f742cf90b5e27c.webm?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/846e646e260375cf28f742cf90b5e27c.mp4?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready for a Challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond pure chaos, Gorilla Attack features <strong>5 unique challenges</strong> to put your skills to the test. Shrink into a tiny gorilla, collect every banana in the city, bring down all the airships, or try your hand at daring parkour runs. Every challenge pushes your rampage to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/f5cffcf7171a3d44805cfb9e20d699e0.poster.avif?t=1769074530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/f5cffcf7171a3d44805cfb9e20d699e0.webm?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/f5cffcf7171a3d44805cfb9e20d699e0.mp4?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorilla Attack</strong> is pure, over-the-top destruction designed for VR. Whether you want to vent, experiment, or simply enjoy the thrill of unstoppable power \u2013 the city is yours to crush.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994330?t=1769074530","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/49574da5d75fbcc0f76e256b83a75c869f5fff5e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769074530","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/40ce1438f4de6a452761f61119ec994972b917f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769074530","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/40ce1438f4de6a452761f61119ec994972b917f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769074530","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put on your VR headset and unleash chaos as a mighty gorilla rampaging through the city!</strong> Smash skyscrapers, grab debris, and hurl it across the streets to destroy everything in your path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can see it, you can break it. Every building crumbles into hundreds of pieces \u2013 and those pieces aren\u2019t just rubble, they\u2019re your weapons. Pick them up, throw them around, and watch the city collapse under your fists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/ed85971cb6ddef4ecaef0bf937d5a129.poster.avif?t=1769074530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass