.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/846e646e260375cf28f742cf90b5e27c.mp4?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready for a Challenge?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond pure chaos, Gorilla Attack features <strong>5 unique challenges</strong> to put your skills to the test. Shrink into a tiny gorilla, collect every banana in the city, bring down all the airships, or try your hand at daring parkour runs. Every challenge pushes your rampage to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/f5cffcf7171a3d44805cfb9e20d699e0.poster.avif?t=1769074530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/f5cffcf7171a3d44805cfb9e20d699e0.webm?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/extras/f5cffcf7171a3d44805cfb9e20d699e0.mp4?t=1769074530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gorilla Attack</strong> is pure, over-the-top destruction designed for VR. Whether you want to vent, experiment, or simply enjoy the thrill of unstoppable power \u2013 the city is yours to crush.</p>","developers":["Take IT Studio!"],"dlc":[4007830],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994330/8e3b0602a94b653fb7276ca0ec248619bf1f3d45/header.jpg?t=1769074530","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3994330/939161282/0ad9dcf1d70e1c2863eff7ce8a48f66ea59e25b6/1756375354/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756893845","dash_h264":"https://video.akam